dsh-digital-earth
================

This product bundles CesiumJS 1.147.0 (vendor/cesium), which is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is included at
vendor/cesium/LICENSE.md; Cesium's own third-party notices are under
vendor/cesium/ThirdParty.

Cesium® is a registered trademark of Cesium GS, Inc. This plugin is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Cesium GS, Inc.

Imagery and elevation are streamed at runtime from public ArcGIS services and
remain subject to Esri's terms of use.

The loading globe's bundled land mask is derived from the Natural Earth II
textures included with CesiumJS (vendor/cesium/Assets/Textures/NaturalEarthII).
Natural Earth raster data is in the public domain: https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
